  "entities": [
    {
      "attributes": {
        "description": null,
        "external_dependencies": null,
        "path": "opsdir/opsdir/domains/governance/",
        "purpose": "Owners (parties: parties.py display_name/operator/operator_label), change records, incidents and work instructions. Import runs keyed by importer + environment/shared + scope set (imports.py: run_dn, scope_set_key, runs_covering, reports imports and import-scopes, check_import_runs with fix imports/scope-set-names for legacy-named runs) and collection attempts. Collection sources (collection.py: collection_sources, and the collectors' shared idiom readable_sources / readable_source, source_problems, scheme_problems). The unknowns register (ciamUnknown questions the planner counts: check_unknowns, report unknowns). ITSM ticket evidence (tickets.py: ciamTicketRef on ciamChange; observed ciamTicket under ou=<adapter>,ou=tickets with approval steps and change type; vocabularies TICKET_STATES/TICKET_APPROVALS/TICKET_CHANGE_TYPES in schema.py; drift states, check_tickets, report tickets; never an approval). Stale-runbook view and report."
      },
      "kind": "modules",
      "op": "modify",
      "semantic_key": {
        "name": "domain-governance"
      }
    },
